
### 1. Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/health

### 2. Analyze migration - DROP COLUMN
POST http://127.0.0.1:4000/migrations/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "ALTER TABLE users DROP COLUMN email;"
}

### 3. Analyze migration - DROP TABLE
POST http://127.0.0.1:4000/migrations/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "DROP TABLE users;"
}

### Execute a test migration
POST http://localhost:4000/migrations/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sql": "CREATE TABLE execution_test (id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY, message TEXT);"
}